<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine Feb unemployment rises to 1.56 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine Feb unemployment rises to 1.56 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Ukraine rose to 1.56 percent of the labour force in January, or 431,951 unemployed, from 1.38 percent of the labour force in February, or 380,811 unemployed, the Statistics Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It gave the following data:</p>
<p> UKRAINIAN UNEMPLOYMENT     Feb 97     Jan 97     Feb 96</p>
<p> number of unemployed	 431,951    380,811    172,114</p>
<p> pct of labour force	  +1.56	+1.38	not available</p>
<p>NOTE - Official information in Ukraine, with a population of 51 million people, tends to understate unemployment levels.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
